 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "In the winter of 1843",
   "word": "in",
   "word_t": 4.856,
   "frame": 116,
   "end_frame": 163,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the London streets were filled",
   "word": "the",
   "word_t": 6.8313,
   "frame": 163,
   "end_frame": 204,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "with the charm of Christmas",
   "word": "with",
   "word_t": 8.5153,
   "frame": 204,
   "end_frame": 254,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Behind the desk sat a gentleman",
   "word": "behind",
   "word_t": 10.5877,
   "frame": 254,
   "end_frame": 308,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "surrounded by envelopes",
   "word": "surrounded",
   "word_t": 12.8393,
   "frame": 308,
   "end_frame": 349,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and letters",
   "word": "and",
   "word_t": 14.5633,
   "frame": 349,
   "end_frame": 365,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His name was",
   "word": "his",
   "word_t": 15.2397,
   "frame": 365,
   "end_frame": 381,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sir Henry Cole",
   "word": "sir",
   "word_t": 15.9007,
   "frame": 381,
   "end_frame": 414,
   "fade_out": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He had a rather simple problem",
   "word": "he",
   "word_t": 20.3443,
   "frame": 488,
   "end_frame": 533,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There are so many people",
   "word": "there",
   "word_t": 22.2303,
   "frame": 533,
   "end_frame": 557,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "he wanted to wish",
   "word": "he",
   "word_t": 23.2333,
   "frame": 557,
   "end_frame": 573,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "a Merry Christmas",
   "word": "a",
   "word_t": 23.8963,
   "frame": 573,
   "end_frame": 597,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "but he had so little time",
   "word": "but",
   "word_t": 24.8813,
   "frame": 597,
   "end_frame": 635,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to write them all",
   "word": "to",
   "word_t": 26.4607,
   "frame": 635,
   "end_frame": 656,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So he turned to his friend",
   "word": "so",
   "word_t": 27.3393,
   "frame": 656,
   "end_frame": 684,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "an artist named",
   "word": "an",
   "word_t": 28.527,
   "frame": 684,
   "end_frame": 712,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "John Callcott Horsley",
   "word": "john",
   "word_t": 29.671,
   "frame": 712,
   "end_frame": 749,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Together they came up",
   "word": "together",
   "word_t": 31.2483,
   "frame": 749,
   "end_frame": 776,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "with a lovely idea",
   "word": "with",
   "word_t": 32.3733,
   "frame": 776,
   "end_frame": 814,
   "fade_out": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead of writing",
   "word": "instead",
   "word_t": 37.011,
   "frame": 888,
   "end_frame": 911,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "a different letter",
   "word": "a",
   "word_t": 37.996,
   "frame": 911,
   "end_frame": 928,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to every single friend",
   "word": "to",
   "word_t": 38.699,
   "frame": 928,
   "end_frame": 964,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "why not send an illustration",
   "word": "why",
   "word_t": 40.1827,
   "frame": 964,
   "end_frame": 1004,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "carrying the warmth",
   "word": "carrying",
   "word_t": 41.8537,
   "frame": 1004,
   "end_frame": 1032,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of Christmas",
   "word": "of",
   "word_t": 43.0407,
   "frame": 1032,
   "end_frame": 1056,
   "fade_out": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Horsley painted",
   "word": "horsley",
   "word_t": 47.8243,
   "frame": 1147,
   "end_frame": 1165,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "a family gathering",
   "word": "a",
   "word_t": 48.5463,
   "frame": 1165,
   "end_frame": 1189,
   "fade_out": false
  },
  {
   "text": "with a lot of kindness",
   "word": "with",
   "word_t": 49.5613,
   "frame": 1189,
   "end_frame": 1218,
   "fade_out": false
  },
